{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"やーい(¨)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さっき\nぼーっとしてたら\n電車乗るところで\n電車とホームの間に脚落ちた←"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"右脚が完全に落ちた！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"顔から火が　出なかった"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乗ったり降りようとしてた見知らぬ方々が\n手を貸してくださったんだが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"気づいたら中田は\n「あー　ぼーっとしちゃった」\nと言ってた"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"恥ずかしい状況下において\n初めましての方々に\n恥ずかしがりもせず\n話した自分にびっくりした"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2013/01/14/8923077/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さーて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日は個別！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"宿題ね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ループしすぎて話題ないとき\n教えてくださーい(・ω・)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2013/01/14/8923077/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつも持ってるものは？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2013/01/14/8923077/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"デートで握手会ってあり？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あと、持ち物チェック"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"□握手券\n□納品書\n□身分証明書\n(□トレード用の写真等)\n(□グッズ買うためのお金)\n(□手紙とかプレゼント)\n□推しに対する愛"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来てくださるかた待ってます(・ω・)"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2013/01/14/8923077/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「「答えちゃうお( °_ゝ°)ノ」」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"コーンスープ飽きた？\n⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒\n飽きてないよ！\nけど今はコーンスープより\nかぼちゃのスープをよく飲んでる←"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今季のドラマは何見る？\n⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒\n恒例のね！月曜日から順番に(・ω・)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ビブリア古書堂の事件手帖\n終電バイバイ\nLAST HOPE（ラストホープ）\nサキ\nシェアハウスの恋人\nあぽやん 　走る国際空港\n最高の離婚\nお助け屋★陣八\n夜行観覧車\nまほろ駅前番外地\nミエリーノ柏木\n泣くな、はらちゃん\nカラマーゾフの兄弟\ndinner\nとんび"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつも同じ枠だね〜(・ω・)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"人混み平気な方？\n⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒\n平気だよ〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"渋谷だったらどこで買い物する？\n⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒\nマルイジャムだね！\nほぼマルイジャムの2Ｆ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"以上！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2013/01/14/8923077/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"生駒ちゃんかっこよすぎて\n照れて\n目がいっちゃってたので\n隠しました(*゜ロ゜)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2013/01/14/8923077/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かな￣(=∵=)￣"}],"source":"archive"}